WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.268
(Student Council Office)

00:01.270 --> 00:03.930
So while we're on this topic,
(Student Council Office)

00:04.290 --> 00:07.910
after checking the condition
of older desks and chairs,

00:08.270 --> 00:10.730
we'll see if they are worth replacing
and plan a budget...

00:12.010 --> 00:13.510
What's the matter, Kageyama?

00:13.510 --> 00:15.580
Are you not feeling well?

00:29.960 --> 00:33.580
I-I'm sorry... I... I have
to leave early today!

00:33.580 --> 00:34.900
Hey, Kageyama!

00:36.060 --> 00:39.030
Brother! Wait, could this be from
the shock of getting rejected...?

00:39.830 --> 00:40.880
I'm sorry.

00:41.180 --> 00:43.450
I actually like someone else.

00:50.990 --> 00:53.790
Wait for me, Brother! I'll be right there!

01:08.910 --> 01:10.210
This is Brother's.

01:16.000 --> 01:16.950
Wait...

01:17.600 --> 01:19.100
Was he in an accident?

01:24.334 --> 01:26.044
(MOB MOB WOW!)

01:27.164 --> 01:28.914
(MOB MOB WOW!)

01:30.084 --> 01:31.754
(MOB MOB WOW!)

01:32.924 --> 01:34.594
(MOB MOB WOW!)

01:36.004 --> 01:38.724
I realized that our youth is gray

01:38.724 --> 01:41.644
The origin of this uneasiness
Is yet unknown

01:41.724 --> 01:44.144
Trains of emotions keep running
Through my brain

01:44.144 --> 01:47.314
Struggling through this adolescence

01:47.434 --> 01:50.274
Don't disturb my deep psyche

01:50.274 --> 01:52.944
Who is that behind you?

01:53.064 --> 01:56.734
Opposing ideas creates distortion

01:56.734 --> 02:00.154
Exorcise all the sorrow

02:00.324 --> 02:03.824
So, do what you can now

02:03.914 --> 02:05.744
My life

02:05.994 --> 02:09.874
Finally, break it down

02:11.374 --> 02:14.214
(Want) Both greed
(Young) And honesty

02:14.214 --> 02:17.094
(Burn) Are growing
(1) On this chest of mine

02:17.094 --> 02:19.844
(Trance) I'm not waking up
(Chance) I want to wake up

02:19.844 --> 02:22.804
(Stance) These two different faces of mine
(1) Are standing back-to-back

02:22.804 --> 02:25.304
Taking things as it is

02:25.304 --> 02:28.724
In this free relation where
We resent each other

02:28.814 --> 02:31.024
Once these two become one

02:31.024 --> 02:33.024
That smile becomes one

02:33.024 --> 02:36.114
And only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:36.774 --> 02:39.784
"1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:40.114 --> 02:41.194
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:41.194 --> 02:44.074
One and only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:44.244 --> 02:45.784
"1"

02:45.784 --> 02:46.954
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:46.954 --> 02:49.244
One and only "1"

02:51.020 --> 02:55.520
Mob 3
~Trauma~

03:05.650 --> 03:07.190
The shop...

03:08.970 --> 03:12.690
I'm so sorry, Manager!

03:14.370 --> 03:17.840
Damn it. I guess we aren't
enough to stop him after all.

03:20.600 --> 03:21.730
What the?!

03:21.730 --> 03:23.550
Now there's an explosion behind us?

03:27.950 --> 03:30.590
Wait, seriously?

03:30.590 --> 03:32.940
Wh-What are you doing here...

03:33.710 --> 03:34.890
Boss?

03:36.490 --> 03:40.160
Well, well... It looks like you two
are making an honest living now.

03:40.890 --> 03:43.900
Leave the rest to me.

03:46.550 --> 03:48.650
I've come to repay my debt.

03:48.650 --> 03:51.490
Sorry,
but this will probably hurt a little.

04:28.220 --> 04:30.300
I thought you might be in a bad mood...

04:30.630 --> 04:32.940
But you actually seem rather well.

04:32.940 --> 04:35.910
Or rather, you seem like
you've been liberated.

04:35.910 --> 04:38.610
I guess you've given up on holding back.

04:38.610 --> 04:41.470
That in itself isn't a bad thing,

04:42.130 --> 04:44.290
but are you really the same person?

04:53.140 --> 04:57.220
To think there'd be this
much of a difference...

05:01.670 --> 05:03.720
Man, that was close.

05:03.720 --> 05:06.560
Don't get your ass kicked
so easily, old man!

05:06.560 --> 05:07.980
You could've died!

05:08.450 --> 05:11.370
Sho... What are you doing here?

05:12.200 --> 05:15.990
I'm helping my good-for-nothing dad
do some good for society.

05:16.350 --> 05:18.860
I am your son, after all.

05:19.680 --> 05:22.910
Huh? Wait, that's...

05:23.290 --> 05:24.590
It's Shigeo Kageyama.

05:25.310 --> 05:27.560
He's lost control of his powers,

05:27.560 --> 05:30.550
and something has been
unleashed from within him.

05:31.270 --> 05:36.130
Seriously? I don't know how I feel
about fighting Ritsu's bro.

05:36.130 --> 05:40.770
But being gentle won't do
any good in this situation.

05:41.330 --> 05:44.270
Can't say I've actually
ever seen you be gentle.

05:49.130 --> 05:50.240
A direct hit?!

05:51.230 --> 05:53.950
Dad! Hey, you okay?

05:53.950 --> 05:55.010
Calm down.

05:59.260 --> 06:04.920
I just needed to borrow some of his powers
to make up for the massive gap.

06:05.910 --> 06:08.070
So you got hit on purpose?

06:08.070 --> 06:09.920
This fight has only just begun.

06:10.460 --> 06:12.110
Are you going to help me, Sho?

06:12.110 --> 06:13.130
You got a plan?

06:13.640 --> 06:17.660
If he continues to
unleash energy at that rate,

06:17.660 --> 06:20.010
he will eventually run out of stamina.

06:20.270 --> 06:22.970
We just need to buy some time
until he stops.

06:23.430 --> 06:25.330
So we're trying to get
him to run outta gas.

06:25.740 --> 06:26.680
Got it.

06:32.220 --> 06:33.200
Brother.

06:33.900 --> 06:38.490
Ever since that incident, we've stopped
speaking our minds with each other.

06:39.720 --> 06:43.550
Feeling responsible changed my brother.

06:44.390 --> 06:46.840
He used to get mad and laugh...

06:47.450 --> 06:51.070
When we were little, he would
let his emotions show.

06:51.920 --> 06:55.340
But then, he stopped willingly
showing his powers.

06:58.110 --> 07:04.510
This version of him was created from
being suppressed and locked away.

07:05.450 --> 07:09.550
They're connected deep down
and cannot be separated.

07:10.640 --> 07:14.280
We have to continue living
with him from now on, too.

07:21.390 --> 07:22.450
Teru?!

07:24.270 --> 07:25.780
Follow my lead.

07:25.780 --> 07:27.270
I know!

07:50.950 --> 07:52.360
Have a nice flight!

07:52.360 --> 07:54.310
Charge Bomb!

08:12.510 --> 08:13.950
Seriously?

08:13.950 --> 08:15.380
So that's his play.

08:15.990 --> 08:20.560
Wait, wait, wait.
He just sucked up everything we had.

08:21.600 --> 08:22.510
Damn it!

08:24.770 --> 08:25.420
Shit!

08:35.870 --> 08:38.470
The hell do you think you're doing?

08:39.510 --> 08:40.480
H-Hey...

08:41.970 --> 08:45.190
We can't even buy some time?

08:45.900 --> 08:49.370
This is beyond us!
Let's get the hell outta here!

08:49.370 --> 08:50.430
It's futile.

08:50.430 --> 08:53.060
I'm not going to be able to
escape, wounded like this.

09:05.400 --> 09:08.570
Something's wrong.
What the hell's going on?

09:10.420 --> 09:12.970
He's... struggling?

09:13.400 --> 09:16.540
Is he... fighting back inside?

09:17.520 --> 09:20.140
I guess Ritsu's bro is still fighting...

09:20.780 --> 09:23.430
against his out-of-control powers.

09:25.010 --> 09:27.610
You really are strong.

09:29.860 --> 09:31.990
This is our best chance.

09:32.820 --> 09:35.580
Sho, you need to run away.

09:35.580 --> 09:37.380
What?! What about you?

09:38.020 --> 09:41.550
There's one way to stop him.

09:42.280 --> 09:46.450
I will become a vessel and
absorb all of his energy.

09:46.450 --> 09:48.930
I just need to do
what he did for me last time.

09:49.530 --> 09:50.690
That again?

09:51.290 --> 09:54.340
That's insane. You're going to break.

09:54.340 --> 09:57.470
That's fine. If I sacrifice myself...

09:57.470 --> 09:58.900
The hell are you talking...

09:58.900 --> 10:00.400
I'm prepared for this.

10:20.250 --> 10:21.330
Dad.

10:50.950 --> 10:52.040
I'm sorry.

10:52.960 --> 10:57.270
It seems I can't be as strong as you are.

10:59.370 --> 11:02.640
Sho, will you lend me your shoulder?

11:04.180 --> 11:05.250
Let's flee.

11:16.150 --> 11:20.240
This is worse than we thought.
Even Suzuki couldn't get the job done.

11:20.930 --> 11:22.310
Let's go grab him.

11:22.310 --> 11:23.160
Yes, sir.

11:23.160 --> 11:25.210
Dropping the guide drones.

11:29.100 --> 11:30.870
Psychic powers are terrifying.

11:31.810 --> 11:36.830
I guess he already knew that
this power was taboo.

11:37.110 --> 11:41.800
Yeah, I know. I won't use mine anymore.

11:42.560 --> 11:45.890
Living normally is the most
important thing, right?

11:46.990 --> 11:51.090
It's difficult... But that's what
he's done this whole time.

11:55.290 --> 11:58.370
What's going to happen to that guy now?

11:59.530 --> 12:02.400
No one will be able to stop him.

12:06.910 --> 12:10.250
You've gone way too far, Brother...

12:19.820 --> 12:22.220
Kageyama!

12:23.310 --> 12:26.480
So you are still here.

12:26.480 --> 12:27.850
We're here to help you!

12:27.850 --> 12:29.930
Let's take shelter at the gym together!

12:32.270 --> 12:34.620
That is Kageyama... right?

12:34.620 --> 12:36.480
Answer us, damn it!

12:46.200 --> 12:50.070
That was no ordinary gust of wind, was it?

12:50.500 --> 12:56.050
I believe that Kageyama must be in
some kind of sleepwalking state.

12:56.240 --> 12:58.400
Yeah, I think so.

12:58.400 --> 13:00.010
Which means...

13:02.340 --> 13:05.630
We definitely can't leave him alone.

13:05.950 --> 13:07.850
Body Improvement...

13:07.850 --> 13:10.590
Fight on!

13:14.390 --> 13:16.310
He just brushed us off like flies...

13:16.610 --> 13:19.260
Does this mean that Kageyama...

13:19.610 --> 13:22.070
was this powerful
without us even realizing it?

13:22.450 --> 13:23.760
But you know...

13:23.760 --> 13:28.880
We always look up to how you
usually are, too, Kageyama.

13:29.290 --> 13:32.250
So could you consider
going back to normal?

13:33.540 --> 13:34.660
Stop!

13:41.960 --> 13:43.090
This is dangerous.

13:45.680 --> 13:47.880
So you really are in that state.

13:50.240 --> 13:51.630
It's been a while.

13:52.790 --> 13:53.770
Brother.

13:55.630 --> 13:58.930
I've always been terrified
about this happening.

13:59.900 --> 14:02.260
I've been cowering all
this time wondering

14:02.990 --> 14:06.240
when that alternate version of you
would appear again.

14:08.140 --> 14:09.210
I hate it.

14:10.090 --> 14:13.970
But I'm not scared anymore.
I finally figured it out.

14:15.220 --> 14:17.310
This isn't a separate,
scary version of you.

14:18.180 --> 14:20.980
It's a part of you.

14:22.160 --> 14:23.820
So there's no reason to be scared.

14:24.400 --> 14:26.970
There's no reason to tremble
at the sight of it.

14:27.890 --> 14:29.120
Because I'm...

14:30.030 --> 14:31.340
your younger brother.

14:33.250 --> 14:37.050
No, Ritsu. You're wrong!

14:37.050 --> 14:39.020
That's not me!

14:42.570 --> 14:45.200
Ritsu, you need to...

14:45.910 --> 14:50.440
get away from that thing!

14:52.840 --> 14:53.840
Brother.

14:54.370 --> 14:56.880
You don't need to suffer alone like this.

14:58.760 --> 14:59.910
Is something wrong?

15:00.740 --> 15:02.720
I'll be happy to listen if
something's bothering you.

15:04.500 --> 15:07.590
Nope, I'm fine! Thanks, though.

15:08.840 --> 15:12.540
The truth was...
I wanted us to talk it out.

15:13.960 --> 15:15.650
But looking back on it now...

15:16.820 --> 15:21.110
I guess you were holding something
in that you couldn't tell me...

15:21.890 --> 15:24.490
by putting a lid on your powers.

15:26.880 --> 15:28.800
I don't want to hurt him.

15:28.800 --> 15:30.910
At this rate, the same thing will...

15:31.360 --> 15:35.350
But I don't want you to
change anymore, Brother.

15:36.300 --> 15:38.090
Don't try to bear this on your own.

15:38.740 --> 15:40.130
I'm here for you!

15:41.310 --> 15:43.750
I can't hold him any longer!

15:49.220 --> 15:53.390
I can't move! My powers don't
stand a chance against him!

15:55.870 --> 15:59.660
Are you telling me that there's
nothing I can do for Brother...?

16:00.880 --> 16:05.030
Please, stop... You're my powers, right?

16:07.730 --> 16:10.940
That's enough! Listen to me!

16:15.500 --> 16:18.580
It's not stopping... Ritsu's in danger.

16:19.720 --> 16:21.040
If this continues...

16:21.550 --> 16:24.120
If he ends up hurting Takane, too...

16:24.120 --> 16:26.410
He won't be able to bear it.

16:27.700 --> 16:29.220
Then I'll just have to...

16:32.230 --> 16:33.580
That's it.

16:34.170 --> 16:36.950
I'm sure that some shock
will cause a change.

16:38.660 --> 16:41.090
I'm sorry, Brother.

16:49.500 --> 16:50.550
No!

16:51.220 --> 16:53.230
He shouldn't be held down by trauma!

16:54.970 --> 16:58.560
The thing I can do for you, Brother...

17:02.720 --> 17:08.210
...is to continue being the little
brother you can talk to at any time.

17:09.360 --> 17:12.700
It's to become the little brother
you can speak your mind with!

17:12.720 --> 17:13.670
(Ritsu)

17:20.650 --> 17:22.720
I finally figured it out.

17:24.350 --> 17:26.630
The reason I wanted powers...

17:27.500 --> 17:29.310
was for this moment!

17:31.470 --> 17:34.480
You'll be okay now, Brother.

17:58.840 --> 17:59.720
No!

17:59.720 --> 18:02.380
Stop!

18:14.410 --> 18:18.670
A giant tornado has now appeared
inside Seasoning City.

18:19.410 --> 18:23.840
It continues to slowly move
along, surging eerily.

18:24.360 --> 18:26.580
Why are these things occurring
in the same region,

18:26.580 --> 18:30.050
and why are they happening
one after another?

18:30.790 --> 18:33.000
According to some experts,

18:33.000 --> 18:37.050
there are theories that this is the result
of some top secret science project,

18:37.050 --> 18:41.160
and some suspect that
this is the work of psychics.

18:41.890 --> 18:44.870
According to the emergency press
conference held by the government,

18:44.870 --> 18:48.820
no government agencies are
involved with these...

18:52.310 --> 18:55.660
There's no entry beyond this point.
You can't come in.

18:56.060 --> 18:57.090
H-Hey!

18:57.090 --> 18:58.340
Hold it!

19:06.710 --> 19:10.330
I guess that was about all I could do...

19:11.550 --> 19:14.450
Come back to us, Brother...

19:21.100 --> 19:22.260
Found you.

19:25.370 --> 19:29.280
What are you? Why are you doing this?

19:34.150 --> 19:37.580
I am me. I'm Shigeo Kageyama.

19:38.180 --> 19:39.970
Who are you supposed to be?

19:40.370 --> 19:44.360
Huh? I'm Shigeo Kageyama...

19:44.360 --> 19:46.380
Ah, so you're "Mob."

19:46.830 --> 19:48.420
The fake me.

19:48.870 --> 19:50.540
You're the fake one here.

19:51.020 --> 19:53.910
I don't need these powers anymore.

19:53.910 --> 19:55.790
I need you to disappear from within me.

19:56.050 --> 20:00.130
Then you should just disappear.
I will live freely.

20:00.550 --> 20:02.020
I will stop you.

20:02.280 --> 20:04.360
No one can stop me.

20:12.030 --> 20:15.080
Is it just me,
or do you feel sluggish, too?

20:15.080 --> 20:19.030
It might be dangerous to go any farther.

20:19.030 --> 20:22.330
But Mob's in the center
of that tornado, right?

20:22.720 --> 20:23.910
Probably...

20:23.910 --> 20:27.500
But I'm not sure if we'll make it out
in one piece even if we get there...

20:28.000 --> 20:31.590
You just need to help me
get there. Please.

20:34.380 --> 20:35.590
All right.

20:35.590 --> 20:37.680
I'll do everything that I can.

20:40.580 --> 20:42.330
All right, let's go!

20:44.890 --> 20:46.460
Why are you doing this?

20:47.390 --> 20:50.020
Do you remember being hit by a car?

20:50.990 --> 20:53.050
I couldn't move anymore
with just my body alone.

20:55.180 --> 20:57.730
That's why I had to move
through sheer will.

20:58.100 --> 21:02.030
What are you talking about?
This isn't my will at all.

21:02.030 --> 21:05.480
You have a very strong desire
to go see Tsubomi.

21:06.350 --> 21:10.000
That is the most important thing to me.

21:11.590 --> 21:13.090
But that's...

21:13.620 --> 21:16.680
That's not something you should be
doing at the cost of harming others.

21:17.140 --> 21:19.920
This isn't normal.

21:20.220 --> 21:25.930
What is normal? Are you trying
to invalidate me once again?

21:27.910 --> 21:33.940
If you just break and disappear,
I won't have to hold back anymore.

21:34.580 --> 21:36.930
I'm going to do what I want.

21:43.890 --> 21:46.080
The next time you wake up,

21:46.750 --> 21:48.950
I will be me.

21:50.980 --> 21:53.420
Goodbye, Mob.

21:55.520 --> 22:00.360
The blue light shined
Dazzling my eye at 01:30 AM

22:00.400 --> 22:05.740
Even as I swiped the page over,
The smiles of friends besides me remain

22:15.750 --> 22:18.170
Yes, I want someone to understand

22:18.170 --> 22:20.670
All the colorless and transparent wishes

22:20.670 --> 22:23.170
All the breath stuck within
The depth of my heart

22:23.170 --> 22:25.800
Suddenly flowed out
Bringing my consciousness back

22:25.800 --> 22:28.260
I remember the days hung dry

22:28.260 --> 22:30.770
The very normal days passed by

22:30.770 --> 22:33.230
Even if reality is corrupted

22:33.230 --> 22:35.980
The sky we saw together
Was definitely real

22:36.560 --> 22:40.690
It's harder to understand than
The grammar on the blackboard

22:40.690 --> 22:45.910
The story that disappears
Under 24 hours makes me sad and lonely

22:46.160 --> 22:50.370
It's so hard, and I find myself
On the verge of giving up again and again

22:50.370 --> 22:51.910
But I...

22:52.750 --> 22:56.080
The current me will no longer give up

22:56.210 --> 23:01.090
Overflowing emotions on my sleeve,
Running through worry and doubt

23:01.090 --> 23:03.723
Nobody has decided
if the future is 0 or 100,

23:03.725 --> 23:06.300
So I'll paint over them myself

23:06.300 --> 23:08.691
Even if my existence itself
can't be proven,

23:08.693 --> 23:11.721
If this world struck me in my heart

23:11.850 --> 23:14.390
I will flood it with cobalt blue

23:26.260 --> 23:28.420
Hey, Mob. Wait...

23:28.710 --> 23:29.460
Listen to me!

23:29.960 --> 23:32.420
There's something... I need to tell you!

23:33.510 --> 23:36.710
Next time on
Mob Psycho 100 III Episode 12:

23:37.050 --> 23:39.330
"Confession ~The Future~."
